          "type": "UObject*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Out Locator",
          "type": "FUniversalObjectLocator&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "public : bool",
      "docs": "Called when Sequencer has created an object binding for a possessable object\n@param ObjectId The guid used to map to the possessable object.  Note the guid can be bound to multiple objects at once\n@param PossessedObject The runtime object which was possessed.\n@param Context Optional context required to bind the specified object (for instance, a parent spawnable object)\n@see UnbindPossessableObjects"
