          "type": "TSharedPtr<FSharedPlaybackState>"
        },
        {
          "name": "Out Objects",
          "type": "TArray<UObject*,TInlineAllocator<1>>&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Locate all the objects that correspond to the specified object ID, using the specified parameters.\nCalling this directly instead of IMovieScenePlayer::ResolveBoundObjects means that you won't be able to locate Spawnable objects or objects from Custom Bindings.\n@param ObjectId\t\t\t\tThe unique identifier of the object.\n@param ResolveParams\t\t\tResolve parameters specifying the context and fragment-specific parameters\n@param SharedPlaybackState   Optional ptr to SharedPlaybackState\n@param OutObjects\t\t\tDestination array to add found objects to"
    },
